    <string-array name="welcome_gestures">
        <item>Swipe up on the desktop for all apps, swipe down to search.</item>
        <item>Swipe left or right to change workspace, or tap its number in the top panel or the taskbar.</item>
        <item>Long press the desktop to add widgets, change the wallpaper or arrange things.</item>
        <item>Drag a window by its title bar, resize it from any edge, double tap the title to maximise.</item>
        <item>With a keyboard: Ctrl K searches, Ctrl 1 to 9 switch workspaces, Alt F4 closes a window.</item>
    </string-array>
